{"ticker":"LUNR","updated":"2026-10-30T22:57:26Z","profile":{"longName":"Intuitive Machines, Inc.","shortName":"Intuitive Machines, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.intuitivemachines.com","fullTimeEmployees":525,"marketCap":1722276352,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-68.83871,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.5139892,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":29.0,"targetHighPrice":43.0,"targetLowPrice":13.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":9,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":3.098,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.16349001,"operatingMargins":-0.18099001,"profitMargins":-0.26635998,"totalRevenue":490120000,"beta":1.864,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":46.75,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":7.78,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NGM","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Intuitive Machines, Inc. operates as a space infrastructure and services company in the United States. The company provides delivery services for the transportation and delivery of payloads, such as satellites, scientific instruments, and cargo to various destinations in space, rideshare delivery, and lunar surface access; data transmission services, which include the collection, processing, and interpretation of space-based data, as well as utilizing AI applications, such as command, control, communications, reconnaissance and prospecting; and infrastructure as a service solutions for navigation, maintenance, scientific data collection, and system health monitoring. It also offers Nova-C lunar lander that combines flight-proven with a scalable design to meet the demands of the emerging lunar economy; Micro Nova Hopper develops propulsive drone that is designed to land, deploy, and hop on the company's IM-2 mission; and Nova-D developed to transport critical payloads, including infrastructure services, such as fission surface power systems, lunar terrain vehicles, and rovers enabling sustainable lunar exploration and development. In addition, the company provides lunar data network. It serves its products to the U.S. government, which include NASA, national security space, U.S. department of Defense, and state governments; commercial; and international customers. The company wa","summary_zh":"Intuitive Machines, Inc. 在美國作為一家空間基礎設施和服務公司運作。該公司提供有效載荷的運輸和交付服務，例如衛星、科學儀器和貨物到太空各個目的地的運輸和交付、共乘交付和月球表面訪問；數據傳輸服務，包括天基數據的收集、處理和解釋，以及利用人工智慧應用，如指揮、控制、通信、偵察和勘探；以及用於導航、維護、科學數據收集和系統健康監控的基礎設施即服務解決方案。它還提供 Nova-C 月球著陸器，該著陸器將經過飛行驗證的與可擴展的設計相結合，以滿足新興月球經濟的需求； Micro Nova Hopper 開發了推進式無人機，旨在執行該公司的 IM-2 任務，用於著陸、部署和跳躍；Nova-D 是為了運輸關鍵系統負載而開發的，包括基礎設施服務，例如裂變錶面電力系統以探索月球地形和月球系統開發的月球系統。此外，該公司還提供月球數據網路。它為美國政府提供產品，其中包括 NASA、國家安全空間、美國國防部和州政府；商業的;和國際客戶。公司是","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":8.47,"h":8.75,"l":8.355,"c":8.71,"v":4335300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":8.71,"h":8.788,"l":8.37,"c":8.46,"v":4870100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":8.45,"h":8.57,"l":8.33,"c":8.42,"v":3468300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":8.57,"h":8.74,"l":8.333,"c":8.49,"v":5704700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":8.495,"h":8.625,"l":8.259,"c":8.44,"v":4271900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":8.41,"h":8.5,"l":8.3,"c":8.41,"v":3431400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":8.47,"h":8.57,"l":8.19,"c":8.3,"v":4836700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":8.28,"h":8.66,"l":8.21,"c":8.52,"v":4568100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":8.5,"h":8.94,"l":8.455,"c":8.78,"v":4628100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":9.125,"h":9.415,"l":8.84,"c":9.04,"v":8779100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":9.0,"h":9.21,"l":8.725,"c":9.15,"v":4803600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":9.08,"h":9.6,"l":8.995,"c":9.28,"v":7095100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":9.5,"h":9.76,"l":9.42,"c":9.58,"v":7806600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":9.7,"h":9.977,"l":9.52,"c":9.71,"v":8423400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":9.56,"h":10.16,"l":9.33,"c":10.13,"v":9954500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":10.33,"h":10.8,"l":10.05,"c":10.36,"v":10710600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":10.5,"h":10.71,"l":9.96,"c":9.99,"v":7628400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":9.64,"h":10.41,"l":9.445,"c":10.1,"v":7625400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":10.03,"h":10.55,"l"